{"Title":"An Act relative to the membership of the PRIM Board","BillNumber":"H2631","DocketNumber":"HD3388","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"AHP1","Name":"Alice Hanlon Peisch","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/AHP1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-17T09:38:34"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"AHP1","Name":"Alice Hanlon Peisch","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/AHP1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-17T09:38:34"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H2631/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Peisch of Wellesley, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 2631) of Alice Hanlon Peisch relative to the membership of the PRIM Board.  Public Service.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Section 23 of chapter 32 of the General Laws, as appearing in the 2020 Official Edition, is hereby amended by inserting, in line 201, after the words “representative of a public safety union” the following words:- from a list of 3 candidates nominated by the executive board of the Massachusetts Association of Contributory Retirement Systems, Inc. who shall be a member of the state employees’ retirement system, the teachers’ retirement system, or any other retirement system that has been vested in the PRIT Fund.\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J23","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J23"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}